This repository contains two kinds of material under two licences.

1. Texts, translations and glossary

The files in data/, text/ and translations/, and glossary.csv, are licensed
under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

The transcriptions, normalised texts and the English and Afrikaans columns in
data/ and text/ are derived from:

  Juan Luis Garcés Pérez and Alexander Lasch, Multilingual working and reading
  versions of the "Genadendal Diaries" from the Utrecht Archives, version 0.3
  (Zenodo, 30 December 2025), doi:10.5281/zenodo.18095167, licensed CC BY 4.0.

Changes made here: the tables were extracted from the PDFs to CSV, a pdf_page
column was added, and joined reading texts were built from two columns. The
text of each cell is unchanged.

The English translations in translations/ and the glossary are new work in
this repository, also licensed CC BY 4.0. When you reuse them, credit this
repository and the edition above.

